      "supporting_excerpt": "Battery cells imported into the US market face a sharp cost increase following the imposition of US president Donald Trump's new tariff regime... China, by far the largest supplier of battery cells to the US market, is now subject to an effective 64.9pc tariffs... Japan and South Korea... face tariff rates of 24pc and 25pc, respectively.",
